  "claims": [
    "The working ROS 2 graph contains /teleop_turtle and /turtlesim.",
    "/teleop_turtle publishes geometry_msgs/msg/Twist to /turtle1/cmd_vel and /turtlesim subscribes to it.",
    "/turtlesim publishes turtlesim_msgs/msg/Pose on /turtle1/pose at approximately 62.49 Hz.",
    "Moving /teleop_turtle to ROS_DOMAIN_ID=17 isolates it from /turtlesim in ROS_DOMAIN_ID=16.",
    "Returning /teleop_turtle to ROS_DOMAIN_ID=16 restores discovery, pose delivery and keyboard control."
